 .../wpe/headless/WPEDisplayHeadless.cpp       | 46 ++++++++++++++++++-
 .../wpe/headless/WPEToplevelHeadless.cpp      |  7 +++
 3 files changed, 52 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)

